            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Nguyen Van Cu",
            "review_text": "Alain Nguyen\nChicago, Illinois1 contribution\n0\nIs it not worth for $$$ you spend.\nMay 2025 • Family\n1st The service is horrible. Take for awhile to put order however when you are asking for the check. It comes really fast. if you are asking for more fish sauce. They just bring enough.\n2nd The restaurant is not clean.\n3rd The pork chop is big but it is not juicy. Look like you eat overcooked meat.\n4th Atmosphere is not quite if you are looking for enjoy the food and have small conversation. This is not the place you are looking for.\n5th Too pricey.\nWe went to this place because we followed YouTube review but I think they overrate this place.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nThey may looking for one time deal customer but it is not for return customer.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 20, 2025",
