            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Nguyen Van Cu",
            "review_text": "Larry & Huong - Savvy Travelers\nRenton, Washington16 contributions\n0\nThe best Cơm tấm sườn nướng!\nJan 2019 • Couples\nI’ve eaten a lot of Cơm tấm sườn nướng in Seattle and in Ho Chi Minh and this place by far has the best tasting meat. I had the pleasure last year to try them out recommended by a friend who visits Vietnam every year and I made sure to come back to bring my wife. They grill the meat out front and you can really taste the deep rich smoke flavor and seasonings. Super tender and flavorful pair it up with Nuoc Mam, pickled vegetables, egg and broken rice oh what a tasty meal. Good portion as we both left super full and ready for a nap. Anytime I am in Ho Chi Minh I will always be sure to get a bite to eat here as I’ve had nothing comes close to the quality. The accompanying soup was also very delicious, great broth! Thank you for a wonderful dining experience for me and my wife who can be hard to please 🤣. I’ll be back again before to eat one of my favorite dishes before I leave to Hanoi and back to America! Try coming early especially if you see the chef out front grilling, we were lucky to get the last 2 soups and Cơm tấm sườn nướng.\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2019",
